  nonce: ea18  # ea18
  message: "Re-confirmed + extended on fresh substrate (dogfood_tranche_07 F125.A4): on the 103 event_publishes edges, FOUR meta keys co-encode the same MQ info — queue_type (kafka 85/rabbitmq 12/sqs 4/redis 2), topic_type (literal 87/variable 16), topic, channel. This row documents channel==topic redundancy; this adds that queue_type and topic_type are TWO further co-emitted, undocumented (0 spec/schema hits) MQ meta keys on the same edges. Folds as a sibling-key facet."  # ea18
